Optional extensions
-------------------
- PCL extension (`--with-pcl`): the Point Cloud Library 1.13.1 (BSD-3-Clause),
  https://github.com/PointCloudLibrary/pcl, built by vcpkg 2023.08.09 (extensions/pcl/install_deps.py,
  `pcl[core,visualization]`, triplet x64-linux / x64-windows) and linked into the library with the
  parts of its dependencies that PCL uses: Boost 1.82.0 (BSL-1.0), Eigen 3.4.0 (MPL-2.0; source at
  https://gitlab.com/libeigen/eigen), FLANN (BSD-3-Clause), Qhull 8.0.2 (Qhull licence), libpng 1.6.39
  (libpng-2.0), zlib 1.2.13 (Zlib), LZ4 1.9.4 (BSD-2-Clause; the GPL-2.0 part of LZ4 is its command
  line tools, not linked), and VTK 9.2.0 (BSD-3-Clause) with the libraries the vcpkg vtk port builds
  (double-conversion, expat, exprtk, {fmt}, FreeType, GLEW, HDF5, JsonCpp, libharu, libjpeg-turbo,
  liblzma, libogg, libtheora, libxml2, NetCDF-C, PEGTL, PROJ, pugixml, SEACAS, SQLite, libtiff,
  utfcpp, verdict). The exact set and the licence text of each is in the copyright files vcpkg
  installs with a build: external/vcpkg/installed/<triplet>/share/<port>/copyright.
- Agnocast extension (`--with-agnocast`, ROS 2 extension): Agnocast 2.1.1 by TIER IV, Inc.
  (agnocastlib and agnocast_heaphook: Apache-2.0), https://github.com/tier4/agnocast; with the ROS 2
  standalone option, libagnocast and libagnocast_heaphook are bundled. Its kernel module
  (agnocast_kmod, Dual BSD/GPL) is installed on the target system separately and is not bundled.
